                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati ule ule Tatenai, liwali wa ng’ambo ya Mto, na Shethar-Bozenai, na wenzi wao, wakawajia, wakawaambia, Ni nani aliyewapa amri kuijenga nyumba hii, na kuumaliza ukuta huu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
